":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"b5cc095da30308e0e6f92802b3cb7af4bdce083a7f42b27e3f54974034be5877\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"7d4d6053dea2c641814e3d16fcd39d8b47db188c6a4ced645d5d14df1c02371d\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Empire TV series Lucious Lyon marriages wives children\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d185\"},\"ref\":\"d185\",\"snippet\":\" ... Though her first picture wasn't as successful as she might have hoped, her sitcom,\\n\\nRoseanne (1988), debuted in 1988 and ran for 9 seasons on ABC, co-starring\\n\\nJohn Goodman. It dealt with real-life issues in a lower middle-class working family. During its first season ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/list/ls051423158/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d141\"},\"ref\":\"d141\",\"snippet\":\" ... company Empire Entertainment, and the drama among the members of the founders' family as they fight for control of it. It stars Terrence Howard, Taraji P. Henson, Bryshere Y. Gray, Jussie Smollett and Trai Byers as members of the Lyon Family, along with a supporting cast including Grace ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Empire_(2015_TV_series)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d24\"},\"ref\":\"d24\",\"snippet\":\" ... We'll never know if Dennis Haysbert's David Palmer plowed the road for Barack Obama's real-life election, but there is no question that 24 peerlessly suspended disbelief and pulled back the veil on the cost and corruption of power in the real and fictional world ... \",\"title\":\"https://deadline.com/2020/12/most-influential-tv-series-21st-century-so-far-deadline-list-1234662438/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d54\"},\"ref\":\"d54\",\"snippet\":\" ... Brandon also starred opposite Matt Smith (The Crown) as real life artist Edward Mapplethorpe, in the film Mapplethorpe, about the life and death of controversial photographer Robert Mapplethorpe, which premiered in competition at the 2018 Tribeca Film Festival.\\n\\nIn 2019 Brandon filmed Lead roles in three feature films ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1990\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d186\"},\"ref\":\"d186\",\"snippet\":\" ... The real-life death of former star Chadwick Boseman has resulted in the elevation of former supporting actors Letitia Wright, Lupita Nyong'o, and Danai Gurira to starring roles, while the film will also feature the on-screen debut of Riri Williams (Dominique Thorne), aka Ironheart. Who will ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.polygon.com/23317910/2022-new-movies-release-schedule-upcoming-preview\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"f28b99a7452357561557b8ac5e952afd93055963705e1f6b44108c7a7f9352b9\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"400f71f15d89c37fecae6e30902bcd1effe51d72c0508904971377a2326d1a83\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Empire cast real life siblings family co-stars\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_3a20231ece00428c9cc23fc5"},{"content":"Let me reconsider the clues more carefully. The \"character married more than 2 but less than 5 times\" with \"only one child survives\" is very specific. This sounds like it could be from a show like \"The Royals,\" \"Jane the Virgin,\" or possibly a telenovela-style drama. Let me think about shows where an actor plays alongside a real-life relative but they're unrelated in the series. Let me search for the specific combination of marriage/child clues.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"TV character married three times only one child survives drama series\", \"character four marriages one surviving child television drama\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_ac1a2c93ebb24573886bf066","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Jane the Virgin Petra Rafael marriages children\", \"Jane the Virgin cast real life siblings family co-stars\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_3eb42b19f07c49478d0bd12f","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d78\"},\"ref\":\"d78\",\"snippet\":\" ... only charged the financially struggling Somers $1 per week. She underwent therapy herself to overcome the problems of her dysfunctional childhood. In the early 1970s, she landed minor roles in film and TV, and finally won a role on the series Three's Company (1976). She married Hamel ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2023&ref_=nmbio_dth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d79\"},\"ref\":\"d79\",\"snippet\":\" ... Violent and uncompromising, the series changed the portrayal of police work on British television and was one of the defining dramas of the 1970s.\\n\\nFor Inspector Morse (1987), Thaw was yet again cast as a policeman, but this time a more cultured character than Regan. The leisurely-paced ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2002\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d80\"},\"ref\":\"d80\",\"snippet\":\" ... His wife and three children survive him, as do three grandchildren.- Actor\\n\\n- Soundtrack\\n\\nHenry Gibson was born on 21 September 1935 in Germantown, Pennsylvania. Before appearing in films and television series, he was a child star on the stage during the 1940s and during the late 1950s he ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2009&ref_=nm_ov_dth_year\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d81\"},\"ref\":\"d81\",\"snippet\":\" ... One of her last roles was on the television series Matador (2014). She also found herself further down the credits in films such as On the Borderline (2001), Transamerica (2005), The Lost City (2005), Mother and Child (2009), The Perfect Family (2011), Plush (2013), and Grandma (2015). Three ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2014\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d10\"},\"ref\":\"d10\",\"snippet\":\" ... been blessed.\\\"\\n\\nThe actor soon left the series, but returned for the finale in 2015.\\n\\nJones, who earned a reported $350,000 per episode during his final season as a full-time cast member on the CBS sitcom, told Houston TV station KHOU that the show \\\"was making ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.eonline.com/photos/9198/child-stars-who-turned-out-all-right\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"9cc506d41c09973bd4231cb1d315aaef5ffe44f972ba8ae07bbf096b86b89be3\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fin